caption: Tradition Paths
tradition-component: tradition-paths

Choose exactly one Tradition Path when Spawn access is gained: Subtle, Metamorphic, or Infused. The choice is fixed under ordinary advancement. The Paths describe how the character's supernatural anatomy relates to their ordinary body and may modify Super or Psi abilities beyond Spawn where stated.
